SDV aebsc:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:5ms+/-0ms, DL: 1ms +/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:5ms +/-0ms, DL: 1ms+/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP:5ms +/-0ms, DL: 1ms+/-0ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 5ms+/-0ms, AD: 1ms+/-0ms)    
    Actuator Signal Alarm (triggered on event, AD: 1ms+/-0ms)
App :
    Component Data_hub :
        Signal Detection_data
        Signal Reaction_data
        Service Fuse_detection:
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar
            subscribe to VSS signal Radar
            publish Detection_data
            periodic 5ms+/-0ms
            execution 1ms+/-0ms
        Service Fuse_camera:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera
            subscribe to Processed_detection
            publish to VSS signal Alarm
            publish Reaction_data
            periodic 5ms+/-0ms
            execution 1ms+/-0ms
    Component AEB_controler :
        Signal Processed_detection
        Service Compute_detection:
            subscribe to Detection_data
            publish Processed_detection
            triggered on Detection_data
            execution 1ms+/-0ms
        Service Compute_reaction:
            subscribe to Reaction_data
            publish to VSS signal Alarm
            publish to VSS signal Brake
            triggered on Reaction_data
            execution 1ms+/-0ms

Functional Chains:
    chain :
    Camera -> 
    Fuse_detection ->
    Compute_detection ->
    Fuse_camera ->
    Compute_reaction ->
    Brake